MERRA-2/SIRS model input/output files are too large to store on Github, so are instead available on tigress-web at Princeton University: https://tigress-web.princeton.edu/~mvchung/ENSO_disease/paper_MERRA2-SIRS-HKU1-data/

NOAA ONI index data is used for the ENSO composites in the MERRA-2/SIRS model.
